ly and efficiently. The limitations associated with these contracts can pose challenges in the healthcare system, highlighting the need for careful management and oversight to ensure that patient care is not compromised. [Data: Entities (15992), Relationships (20351, 20392)]\n\n## Quality of care as a fundamental objective\n\nCALIDAD EN LA ASISTENCIA is a key goal within healthcare management, aiming to improve health outcomes through effective service delivery. The focus on quality care is essential for patient satisfaction and recovery, and it is a critical component of the management strategies employed within this community. The emphasis on quality highlights the need for continuous improvement and adherence to best practices in healthcare. [Data: Entities (15937), Relationships (20350)]\n\n## Cost considerations in healthcare management\n\nCOSTES SANITARIOS refers to the various costs associated with health services, which are a critical consideration in healthcare management. Understanding these costs is essential for making informed decisions regarding resource allocation and ensuring that healthcare services are sustainable. The integration of cost-effective practices into healthcare management is vital for maximizing patient welfare while operating within budget constraints. [Data: Entities (15933), Relationships (20347, 20341)]", "# Mesogestión in Healthcare\n\nThe community focuses on the concept of Mesogestión, which decentralizes management responsibilities within healthcare systems to enhance service delivery and operational efficiency. Key entities include healthcare centers, insurers, and the overarching management framework that connects them.\n\n## Central role of Mesogestión in healthcare management\n\nMesogestión serves as a foundational approach in the healthcare sector, emphasizing decentralized management to improve service delivery. This strategy allows healthcare centers to operate more effectively by coordinating local management efforts, w